[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2392669398","pull_request_review_id":3286489657,"id":2392669398,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6OnTzW","diff_hunk":"@@ -264,10 +264,10 @@ void main() {\n #endif\n \tcolor = linear_to_srgb(color);\n \n-\tfrag_color.rgb = color * luminance_multiplier;\n-\tfrag_color.a = alpha;\n-\n #ifdef USE_DEBANDING\n-\tfrag_color.rgb += interleaved_gradient_noise(gl_FragCoord.xy) * sky_energy_multiplier * luminance_multiplier;\n+\tcolor += interleaved_gradient_noise(gl_FragCoord.xy) * sky_energy_multiplier;\n #endif\n+\n+\tfrag_color.rgb = color * luminance_multiplier;\n+\tfrag_color.a = alpha;","path":"drivers/gles3/shaders/sky.glsl","commit_id":"75492e85bb2d39641a37c5e4ef41d718ca60ec0a","original_commit_id":"75492e85bb2d39641a37c5e4ef41d718ca60ec0a","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"At a glance, this appears to be replacing a sub-optimal and possibly incorrect debanding with a different, but also sub-optimal and possibly incorrect debanding.\r\n\r\nI suspect the correct change would be to remove ` * sky_energy_multiplier * luminance_multiplier` altogether and leave it as simply as the last operation in `main()`:\r\n\r\n```glsl\r\nfrag_color.rgb += interleaved_gradient_noise(gl_FragCoord.xy);\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut maybe `interleaved_gradient_noise` wasn't working well and there was some reason these extra multiplications were added (maybe a different noise function is needed to get this working correctly). Considering all of this, I think it's best to leave this as it was before this PR and correct debanding in a separate PR.","created_at":"2025-09-30T19:50:31Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T19:51:03Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110911#discussion_r2392669398","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110911","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2392669398"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110911#discussion_r2392669398"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110911"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2392669398/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":272,"original_start_line":267,"start_side":"LEFT","line":273,"original_line":272,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":27,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2392772286","pull_request_review_id":3286635532,"id":2392772286,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ons6-","diff_hunk":"@@ -264,10 +264,10 @@ void main() {\n #endif\n \tcolor = linear_to_srgb(color);\n \n-\tfrag_color.rgb = color * luminance_multiplier;\n-\tfrag_color.a = alpha;\n-\n #ifdef USE_DEBANDING\n-\tfrag_color.rgb += interleaved_gradient_noise(gl_FragCoord.xy) * sky_energy_multiplier * luminance_multiplier;\n+\tcolor += interleaved_gradient_noise(gl_FragCoord.xy) * sky_energy_multiplier;\n #endif\n+\n+\tfrag_color.rgb = color * luminance_multiplier;\n+\tfrag_color.a = alpha;","path":"drivers/gles3/shaders/sky.glsl","commit_id":"75492e85bb2d39641a37c5e4ef41d718ca60ec0a","original_commit_id":"75492e85bb2d39641a37c5e4ef41d718ca60ec0a","user":{"login":"Kaleb-Reid","id":78945904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTQ1OTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78945904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid","html_url":"https://github.com/Kaleb-Reid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"@allenwp Since I was already here I just removed a multiplication, the algorithm should be the same. I essentially applied ```(a * c) + (b * c) == (a + b) * c```. I have no clue if this is an optimization that the shader compiler would already be making, but I can remove it.","created_at":"2025-09-30T20:34:51Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T20:34:51Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110911#discussion_r2392772286","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110911","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2392772286"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110911#discussion_r2392772286"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110911"}},